            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>Sacred to Fides Augusta. Gaius Servilius Aper, octovir Augustalis, on account of the honour of his position, built this with his own money, with the permission of his patroness Servilia Bassilla and her daughter, Clodia Prisca, daughter of Quartus.</p>
